exports[`buildCreativePrompt > adiciona o bloco de consistência quando o quadrado tem Story de referência 1`] = `
"[INTRODUCTION]
Create a 1:1 perfect square Instagram post, 1080x1080px advertisement image for a professional brand.
Quality target: standard high-quality digital advertising image.

[DESIGN SYSTEM]


[SAFE ZONE]
LAYOUT RULE — READ FIRST: the top 9.3% and the bottom 9.3% of the image are EMPTY BACKGROUND. No text, no logo, no badge, no button, nothing readable may appear in those bands — they contain only the continuation of the background artwork. Every readable element is grouped together in the band between 9.3% and 90.7% of the image height, and no closer than 9.3% to the left or right edge.
IMAGERY IS NOT RESTRICTED. The photograph, background, gradient, texture and any purely visual element MUST fill the entire frame, edge to edge, full bleed. Never shrink, letterbox or inset the artwork to respect the margins below. A full-bleed background is preferred.
THE MESSAGE IS RESTRICTED. Every element that carries meaning — headline, subheadline, body copy, price, date, badge, brand logo and call-to-action — must sit ENTIRELY inside the safe area described below, because the platform UI (profile picture, caption, CTA button, engagement bar) is drawn on top of everything outside it.
SAFE AREA: keep the top 9.3% and the bottom 9.3% of the frame free of message elements, plus 9.3% on each side. On the nominal 1080x1080 canvas that is the rectangle from x=100 to x=980 and from y=100 to y=980 (880x880px). The percentages are the rule; the pixels are only a reference.
TYPE SIZE. Size the type against the SAFE BOX (880x880px), not against the full frame — type that looks right relative to the whole canvas reads as small once confined to the safe box. At this canvas width use roughly: headline 64-120px, subheadline 40-56px, body and data 28-36px, call-to-action 36-48px. Text must stay legible on a phone screen.
LEAVE BREATHING ROOM. Do not push elements right up against the safe boundary — leave visible margin inside it, so edge cropping on some devices never touches the message.

[VISUAL CONSISTENCY — CRITICAL]
A reference Story version of this same creative is attached as the FIRST image. The square version MUST replicate its EXACT color palette, lighting, color grading, photographic treatment, typography choices and overall mood. Only the framing/composition changes to fit a 1:1 square. Treat that Story as the visual ground truth — do NOT shift hues, saturation, contrast or styling.

[DO NOT INCLUDE]

- Any headline, body copy, logo, badge or call-to-action outside the safe area (outside x 100-980, y 100-980 on the nominal canvas)
- Any text in a language other than Portuguese (Brazil)
- Misspelled, garbled or fake-looking text
- Watermarks, signatures, low-resolution artifacts
- Generic stock-photo aesthetic

All text in the artwork MUST be written in Portuguese (Brazil). Final result: standard high-quality digital advertising image, polished, professional advertising design, sharp typography, brand-grade composition."
`;

