exports[`buildCreativePrompt > monta o prompt mínimo 1`] = `
"[INTRODUCTION]
Create a 9:16 vertical Instagram Story, 1080x1920px advertisement image for a professional brand.
Quality target: ultra high-resolution 4K advertising image, crisp details, sharp typography, premium finish.

[DESIGN SYSTEM]


[SAFE ZONE]
LAYOUT RULE — READ FIRST: the top 14% and the bottom 35% of the image are EMPTY BACKGROUND. No text, no logo, no badge, no button, nothing readable may appear in those bands — they contain only the continuation of the background artwork. Every readable element is grouped together in the band between 14% and 65% of the image height, and no closer than 6% to the left or right edge.
IMAGERY IS NOT RESTRICTED. The photograph, background, gradient, texture and any purely visual element MUST fill the entire frame, edge to edge, full bleed. Never shrink, letterbox or inset the artwork to respect the margins below. A full-bleed background is preferred.
THE MESSAGE IS RESTRICTED. Every element that carries meaning — headline, subheadline, body copy, price, date, badge, brand logo and call-to-action — must sit ENTIRELY inside the safe area described below, because the platform UI (profile picture, caption, CTA button, engagement bar) is drawn on top of everything outside it.
SAFE AREA: keep the top 14% and the bottom 35% of the frame free of message elements, plus 6% on each side. On the nominal 1080x1920 canvas that is the rectangle from x=65 to x=1015 and from y=269 to y=1248 (950x979px). The percentages are the rule; the pixels are only a reference.
COMPOSE HIGHER. The safe area is not centred: its vertical midpoint sits 202px ABOVE the centre of the frame. Anything you centre on the canvas will land too low and be covered. Bias the entire text composition upward, into the upper-middle of the frame.
TYPE SIZE. Size the type against the SAFE BOX (950x979px), not against the full frame — type that looks right relative to the whole canvas reads as small once confined to the safe box. At this canvas width use roughly: headline 64-120px, subheadline 40-56px, body and data 28-36px, call-to-action 36-48px. Text must stay legible on a phone screen.
LEAVE BREATHING ROOM. Do not push elements right up against the safe boundary. Phones taller than this ratio get the creative zoomed in (cropping whatever falls outside the safe area) or letterboxed, and the advertiser does not control which.
BOTTOM-RIGHT CORNER: reserve 40% instead of 35% on the right-hand side of the lower area — the like, comment, share and audio controls stack there.

[DO NOT INCLUDE]

- Any headline, body copy, logo, badge or call-to-action outside the safe area (outside x 65-1015, y 269-1248 on the nominal canvas)
- Any text in a language other than Portuguese (Brazil)
- Misspelled, garbled or fake-looking text
- Watermarks, signatures, low-resolution artifacts
- Generic stock-photo aesthetic

All text in the artwork MUST be written in Portuguese (Brazil). Final result: ultra high-resolution 4K advertising image, crisp details, sharp typography, premium finish, polished, professional advertising design, sharp typography, brand-grade composition."
`;

